<title>JAPAN: Nat'l Bank of Hungary launches 2.75% samurai-Daiwa.</title>
<headline>Nat'l Bank of Hungary launches 2.75% samurai-Daiwa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai bond issue was announced by lead-manager Daiwa Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  National Bank of Hungary</p>
<p> AMT		 50 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.75 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  24 March 2004</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 March 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	March 12 to March 19</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JCR BBB+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    N/A</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
